+    checks.check("D1", tv == tv2 == disagree and not same_support, f"W3 step 0: int (p-q)_+ = int (q-p)_+ = 1 - int min(p,q) = {tv} on a three-point weighted space; the residual densities have disjoint supports, so P(S != S') = TV")
